# #1077: versioned build artifacts mirrored into public/ (8+ GB) must never
# enter the build context — the live copies are served from the native-dist
# bind mount, not the image. A full daemon disk killed the #1115 deploy.
public/mobissh-native-*.apk
public/mobissh-native.apk
public/mobissh-native-macos*.zip
public/*.aab
# #1205: compiled output of the RETIRED PWA. These are gitignored, so a
# long-lived checkout still has them from before the retirement and `COPY
# public/` would bake dead JavaScript into the image. Nothing serves them.
public/app.js
public/modules
hooks
*.md
*.log
.DS_Store
# #1205: the /install-hooks routes were removed, so the image no longer needs
# the install doc or the bridge script — both un-ignored here for that purpose.
